      <section class="intro" id="about" aria-label="About Me">
        <p>Hi, I'm <strong>Shuoqi Li</strong>. I'm an M.S. student in Computer Science at the <strong>University of Southern California</strong>, expecting to graduate in 2028. I graduated from <strong>The Chinese University of Hong Kong</strong> with a B.S. in Computational Data Science and First Class Honours in 2026.</p>
        <p class="detail">My recent work spans webpage screenshot segmentation, reusable UI components, evaluation of generated web pages, and federated recommendation. I'm interested in exploring both software engineering and AI.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="section" id="news" aria-labelledby="news-title">
        <h2 id="news-title"><span class="marker" aria-hidden="true">✦</span> News</h2>
        <ul class="news-list">
          <li><time datetime="2026-08">2026.08</time><p>Our <a href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3770855.3817689">ComUICoder paper</a> was published at KDD 2026.</p></li>
          <li><time datetime="2026-08">2026.08</time><p>Started the M.S. in Computer Science at USC.</p></li>
          <li><time datetime="2026-07">2026.07</time><p>Graduated from CUHK with First Class Honours and completed the ELITE Stream.</p></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section class="section" id="research" aria-labelledby="research-title">
        <h2 id="research-title"><span class="marker" aria-hidden="true">◇</span> Research &amp; Projects</h2>
        <article class="research-item">
          <h3>ComUICoder &amp; ComUIBench</h3><time>Jun 2025 – Jul 2026</time>
          <span class="role">Research Assistant · CUHK Faculty of Engineering · Supervised by Prof. Michael R. Lyu</span>
          <p>I refined screenshot segmentation using UIED detections, implemented graph matching for reusable UI blocks, and built element-level feedback for generated pages. For ComUIBench, I collected related subpages across 40 websites (150 pages) and helped evaluate the system. <a href="https://github.com/WebPAI/ComUICoder">Project code</a></p>
        </article>
        <article class="research-item">
          <h3>Federated recommendation</h3><time>Jun – Aug 2024</time>
          <span class="role">Summer Research Intern · CUHK Faculty of Engineering · Supervised by Prof. Irwin King</span>
          <p>I reproduced recommendation and federated learning models, combined them in a setup that kept user data local, and evaluated the models on public datasets.</p>
        </article>
      </section>
